# --- EB tresos / Eclipse runtime state: NEVER version-control this ---
# Regenerated on every tresos start. Tracking it is actively harmful: with
# core.autocrlf=true a checkout rewrites configuration/org.eclipse.osgi/.manager/.fileTable
# so its last line ends with CRLF instead of LF. Equinox then treats the trailing CRC line
# as a property with an empty value -> StorageManager.updateTable -> Integer.parseInt("")
# -> NumberFormatException -> EclipseStarter.startup fails -> launcher exit code 13
# -> DaVinci Configurator shows "Tresos79003 ... has returned the ExitCode 13".
# If it ever breaks again:  bin\tresos_cmd.bat -clean   (rebuilds this cache)
/CBD2300384_D00/ThirdParty/Mcal_S32k/Supply/tresos/configuration/org.eclipse.osgi/
/CBD2300384_D00/ThirdParty/Mcal_S32k/Supply/tresos/configuration/org.eclipse.equinox.app/
/CBD2300384_D00/ThirdParty/Mcal_S32k/Supply/tresos/configuration/org.eclipse.equinox.launcher/
/CBD2300384_D00/ThirdParty/Mcal_S32k/Supply/tresos/configuration/org.eclipse.update/
/CBD2300384_D00/ThirdParty/Mcal_S32k/Supply/tresos/configuration/.settings/
